Third-party notices
-------------------

This addon bundles no third-party code. It contains no libraries, no embedded
frameworks and no copied data.

AtlasLootClassic (GPL v2) is supported as an optional companion: if it is
installed, Guild Armory reads the tables AtlasLoot has already loaded into the
game's own Lua state, in order to widen item search and show where an item
drops. No AtlasLoot code or data is copied into this addon or distributed with
it, and Guild Armory works without it.

Ideas were taken from several other loot addons (RCLootCouncil, Gargul,
GuildParagon) without taking their code. All of them are separately licensed
and none of them is included here.
